==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[cocoanut]]

===Etymology===
From {{compound|coco|nut|lang=en}}.
[[Image:Beached coconut.JPG|thumb|200px|Beached '''coconut'''.]]
[[Image:Coconut.png|thumb|200px|[[Ivory Coast]]ian '''coconut'''.]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/ˈkoʊ.kə.nʌt/|lang=en}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈkəʊ.kə.nʌt/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[fruit]] of the [[coconut palm]] (not a true nut), ''[[Cocos nucifera]]'', having a [[fibrous]] [[husk]] surrounding a large [[seed]].
# A hard-shelled [[seed]] of this fruit, having white flesh and a [[fluid]]-filled central [[cavity]].
# {{label|en|uncountable}} The [[edible]] white flesh of this fruit.
# The [[coconut palm]].
# {{label|en|pejorative|ethnic slur}} A [[Hispanic]] or dark-skinned person who acts “white” ([[Caucasian]]), [[allude|alluding]] to the fact that a coconut is brown on the outside and white on the inside. Compare {{m|en|banana||East Asian who acts white}}.
# {{label|en|South Africa|pejorative}} A [[black]] person who thinks "white" (European). Compare {{m|en|banana||East Asian who acts white}}.
# {{label|en|New Zealand|pejorative}} A [[Pacific]] [[islander]].
# {{label|en|slang}} A female [[breast]].

